        style 81 fill:#f4f4f6,stroke:#aaaaac,color:#272834
        82["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Candidate Change Generator</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Python]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Proposes lexicon entries,<br />few-shot swaps, prompt edits<br />and taxonomy change requests<br />as a versioned change set.</div>"]
        style 82 fill:#f4f4f6,stroke:#aaaaac,color:#272834
        83["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Threshold Calibrator</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: scikit-learn]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Fits the confidence<br />calibration map and review<br />thresholds on VALIDATION to<br />hit a target precision for<br />Verified rows.</div>"]
        style 83 fill:#f4f4f6,stroke:#aaaaac,color:#272834
        84["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Replay Runner</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Python]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Replays the replay packs<br />against the current and the<br />candidate build and diffs<br />outputs row by row.</div>"]
        style 84 fill:#f4f4f6,stroke:#aaaaac,color:#272834
        85["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Promotion Gate</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Python]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Compares the candidate with<br />the current build on<br />VALIDATION, requires no<br />regression on any error type,<br />then asks the operator to<br />publish. Never uses TEST.</div>"]
        style 85 fill:#f4f4f6,stroke:#aaaaac,color:#272834
        86["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Change Publisher</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Python]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Publishes a change with<br />owner, evidence, version,<br />rollback pointer and validity<br />horizon to the configuration<br />and version registries.</div>"]
        style 86 fill:#f4f4f6,stroke:#aaaaac,color:#272834
        87["<div style='font-weight: bold'>Recertification Scheduler</div><div style='font-size: 70%; margin-top: 0px'>[Component: Python]</div><div style='font-size: 80%; margin-top:10px'>Flags published changes whose<br />validity horizon has passed<br />or whose model/provider<br />version changed silently;<br />re-runs VALIDATION, or FRESH<br />if available.</div>"]
        style 87 fill:#f4f4f6,stroke:#aaaaac,color:#272834
